      ],
      "source": "https://www.ridgecrestneighborhood.org/about-ridgecrest/ridgecrest-history",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from a large plat planned by developer Myrick R. Wood, filed February 17 1941.",
